Package: markdown-viewer
Version: VERSION 
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6, libglib2.0-0 (>= 2.72.4), libadwaita-1-0 (>=1.1.7), libgtk-4-1 (>=4.6.9)
Maintainer: Jens Olsson <jens@rootsy.nu>
Description: This is a GTK-based markdown viewer that refreshes on source changes
 View markdown files and also watch source files, run commands and view the
 output. Auto-refreshes images in the markdown when they change on disk.
